{"step_index":95,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-17T04:24:57Z","model":"gpt-oss-120b-medium","input_tokens":47101,"cache_read_tokens":3839,"output_tokens":409,"thinking":"We have now implemented seller pages and scripts. Need to maybe implement reports.js placeholder. Not required but we can put simple placeholder.\n\nAlso need to ensure navigation works: main.js builds nav based on role. Already handles seller. Should work.\n\nCheck any missing tasks: Seller dashboard script added. Manage-products script fixed bug (line break fixed). Need to import those scripts in HTML pages: already referenced.\n\nMaybe add a simple reports.js file for completeness. Not a requirement but can be placeholder.\n\nLet's add `seller/reports.js` with simple summary generation.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"// reports.js – simple sales summary for the logged‑in seller\\n(function(){\\n    const storage = window.StorageAPI;\\n    const sess = storage.getSession();\\n    if(!sess || sess.role!=='seller'){\\n        alert('Please log in as a seller');\\n        window.location.href='../login.html';\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    const orders = storage.get(storage.keys.orders) || [];\\n    const myOrders = orders.filter(o=>o.items.some(it=>it.sellerId===sess.userId));\\n    const totalRevenue = myOrders.reduce((sum,o)=>sum+o.total,0);\\n    const totalOrders = myOrders.length;\\n    document.getElementById('summary').innerHTML = `\\n        <p><strong>Total Orders:</strong> ${totalOrders}</p>\\n        <p><strong>Total Revenue:</strong> ₹${totalRevenue.toFixed(2)}</p>\\n        <p>(For a beginner project this is a static summary.)</p>\\n    `;\\n})();\"","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\MY-PC\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\68b1e791-e5ed-4ad6-9fc6-05d27d9c0cc7\\\\seller\\\\reports.js\""}}]}
